# Security audit reports.
# These enumerate cluster security posture, scanner findings and remediation
# status. This repo is PUBLIC — an audit report is a roadmap for anyone who
# reads it, even when every finding in it is already fixed. Keep them local.
# Ignored rather than merely left untracked, so a `git add .` cannot sweep one in.
SECRETS-AUDIT-*.md
SECURITY-AUDIT-*.md
*-audit-report.md
